  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">for strengthening the policy and programmatic uptake of cash transfer programs in sub-Saharan Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF USA supports the United Nations Children&#x2019;s Fund by fundraising, advocacy, education, and regranting. This grant will fund work with government counterparts, UNICEF in-country staff, and advocacy groups toward the goals of using existing evidence to advocate for the expansion and increased efficacy of cash transfer programs and making cash transfer programs more sensitive to gender differences and needs.</narrative>
  </description>
